   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8/e0c89ba4-1407-406d-af50-dc665f216277/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Dan Field",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8",
      "timeZone": "Europe/London"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This seems to trace back to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.simplericity.macify/macify"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": "  which has not been updated since 2011 and is becoming deprecated due to the changes in ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://openjdk.org/jeps/272"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Notes for myself as I unpick the dependencies and history",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/jetty-console"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": "  is a fork of ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://github.com/eirbjo/jetty-console"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " the author of whihc appears to be from the same organisation,  simplericity as the macigy dependancy, however I can;t find any evidence of these living in public SCM. THe pom file points at an SVN repo ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/simplericity/macify/macify/1.6/macify-1.6.pom"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/simplericity/macify/macify/1.6/macify-1.6.pom",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " but that is no longer online. It seems that macify is deprecated and unmaintained. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Danny’s solution breaks the encapsulation as per comments ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://bugs.java.com/bugdatabase/view_bug.do?bug_id=JDK-8160437"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": "  however I don’t think this can be relied on going forwards as internal APIs are unsupported post JDK 9. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
