  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I download",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/releases/download/fcrepo-6.2.0/fcrepo-webapp-6.2.0-jetty-console.jar"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": " 6.2.0 of the releases page",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " and run the following with java 19, I’m getting the following error in the stack trace ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "$ java -jar ~/Downloads/fcrepo-webapp-6.2.0-jetty-console.jar\n\nException in thread \"main\" java.lang.RuntimeException: java.lang.reflect.InvocationTargetException\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.startJettyConsole(JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.java:229)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.run(JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.java:123)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.main(JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.java:94)\nCaused by: java.lang.reflect.InvocationTargetException\n\tat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.DirectMethodHandleAccessor.invoke(DirectMethodHandleAccessor.java:119)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.reflect.Method.invoke(Method.java:578)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.startJettyConsole(JettyConsoleBootstrapMainClass.java:227)\n\t... 2 more\nCaused by: java.lang.RuntimeException: java.lang.IllegalAccessException: class org.simplericity.macify.eawt.DefaultApplication cannot access class com.apple.eawt.Application (in module java.desktop) because module java.desktop does not export com.apple.eawt to unnamed module @52d455b8\n\tat org.simplericity.macify.eawt.DefaultApplication.<init>(DefaultApplication.java:69)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleStarter.initAppleExtensions(JettyConsoleStarter.java:209)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleStarter.initSwingApp(JettyConsoleStarter.java:195)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleStarter.run(JettyConsoleStarter.java:160)\n\tat org.simplericity.jettyconsole.JettyConsoleStarter.main(JettyConsoleStarter.java:71)\n\tat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.DirectMethodHandleAccessor.invoke(DirectMethodHandleAccessor.java:104)\n\t... 4 more\nCaused by: java.lang.IllegalAccessException: class org.simplericity.macify.eawt.DefaultApplication cannot access class com.apple.eawt.Application (in module java.desktop) because module java.desktop does not export com.apple.eawt to unnamed module @52d455b8\n\tat java.base/jdk.internal.reflect.Reflection.newIllegalAccessException(Reflection.java:420)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.reflect.AccessibleObject.checkAccess(AccessibleObject.java:709)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.reflect.Method.invoke(Method.java:569)\n\tat org.simplericity.macify.eawt.DefaultApplication.<init>(DefaultApplication.java:64)\n\t... 9 more",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The application actually runs successfully - seems to be a non-critical error.  But when I start Fedora, I get the following popup:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "layout": "align-start"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "collection": "",
        "height": 324,
        "id": "8af7fe81-73db-4e6d-aa48-bb6af75d91c6",
        "type": "file",
        "width": 1554
       },
       "type": "media"
      }
     ],
     "type": "mediaSingle"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If I press “Ok” the browser fails to launch. But I can still access Fedora HTML UI by opening a browser to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I get the same results whether I download the pre-built artifact or built from source using open jdk 19.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "BTW:  Using the following java command line params fixes it.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java --add-opens java.desktop/com.apple.eio=ALL-UNNAMED --add-opens java.desktop/com.apple.eawt=ALL-UNNAMED  -jar ~/Downloads/fcrepo-webapp-6.2.0-jetty-console.jar",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
